' 4+1 vista lógica (código, C4 nível 4) - Código (C4 nível 4) · o agregado Booking (Dom/Bookings/Booking.cs)
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' Para: quem programa.
' Decisão documentada: As regras de uma reserva estão na entidade, que devolve resultados (CancellationOutcome e outros) em vez de lançar exceções.
' Não desenhado: os componentes que chamam a entidade.
@startuml logical-code-booking
!include ../style.puml
title Vista lógica - código (C4 nível 4): o agregado Booking (Dom/Bookings/Booking.cs)

hide empty members

class "Booking" as D_BOOKING <<sealed>> {
  - Booking()
  + Id : Guid
  + PitchId : Guid
  + PlayerId : Guid?
  + CustomerName : string?
  + CustomerPhone : string?
  + IsForCustomer : bool
  + StartsAt : DateTime
  + EndsAt : DateTime
  + Price : decimal
  + Status : BookingStatus
  + CreatedAt : DateTime
  + CancelledAt : DateTime?
  + CancellationReason : string?
  + IsConfirmed : bool
  + SeriesId : Guid?
  ..
  + {static} ForPlayer(pitchId, playerId, startsAt, endsAt, price, now, seriesId = null) : Booking
  + {static} ForCustomer(pitchId, customerName, customerPhone, startsAt, endsAt, price, now) : Booking
  ..
  + CancellationDeadline(window) : DateTime
  + {static} CancellationDeadline(startsAt, window) : DateTime
  + CanBeCancelledByPlayer(window, now) : bool
  + {static} CanBeCancelledByPlayer(status, startsAt, window, now) : bool
  + CancelByPlayer(window, now) : CancellationOutcome
  + CancelByClub(reason, now) : ClubCancellationOutcome
  + MarkNoShow(now) : bool
  + RecordNoShow(now) : NoShowOutcome
  + UndoNoShow() : bool
  + HasStarted(now) : bool
  + Overlaps(startsAt, endsAt) : bool
  ..
  - {static} EnsureWindow(window) : TimeSpan
  - {static} EnsureUtc(value) : DateTime
}

enum "BookingStatus" as D_BOOKING_BookingStatus {
  Confirmed
  CancelledByPlayer
  CancelledByClub
  NoShow
}

enum "CancellationOutcome" as D_BOOKING_CancellationOutcome {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  OutsideWindow
}

enum "ClubCancellationOutcome" as D_BOOKING_ClubCancellationOutcome {
  Cancelled
  NotConfirmed
  AlreadyStarted
}

enum "NoShowOutcome" as D_BOOKING_NoShowOutcome {
  Marked
  NotConfirmed
  NotEnded
}

class "BookingStatuses" as D_BOOKING_BookingStatuses <<static>> {
  + {static} ToCode(status) : string
}

class "BookingRules" as D_BOOKING_BookingRules <<static>> {
  + {static} CancellationReasonMaximumLength = 200
}

D_BOOKING --> D_BOOKING_BookingStatus : Status
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_CancellationOutcome : CancelByPlayer
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_ClubCancellationOutcome : CancelByClub
D_BOOKING ..> D_BOOKING_NoShowOutcome : RecordNoShow
D_BOOKING_BookingStatuses ..> D_BOOKING_BookingStatus : confirmed, cancelled_by_player,\ncancelled_by_club, no_show

note right of D_BOOKING
  **Invariantes nos métodos**
  Todas as propriedades têm private set; o construtor é privado.
  ForPlayer: playerId ≠ Guid.Empty; ForCustomer: nome e telemóvel
  preenchidos (aparados); ambos: EndsAt > StartsAt, Price > 0,
  Status = Confirmed, Id = Guid.CreateVersion7(), instantes UTC.
  Um método que devolve um resultado só muda o estado quando
  o resultado é o de sucesso (Cancelled, Marked, true).
  CancelByClub sem motivo é erro de programação (exceção):
  o serviço valida antes. A janela de cancelamento entra como
  argumento e nunca é guardada na reserva.
  Overlaps é meio aberto [início, fim), como bookings_no_overlap.
end note

@enduml
